  "description": "The meme perpetuates the harmful stereotype that women belong in the kitchen and are not seen as equal participants in decision-making or perspective-sharing. The child (representing the woman) looking out the window while the man is engaged in cooking symbolizes the dismissal of the woman's viewpoint, reinforcing the idea that her perspective is less valid or relegated to domestic roles.",
